  "reasons": {
    "industrial": "Create 6.0.6-6.0.8 addons, IE/IP/IG heavy industry, road vehicles (Ultimate Car Mod), CC peripherals, SFM/Modular Routers/Integrated Dynamics, stationary chests/barrels, and Exposure expansions without AE2/Tom's Storage. Added Functional Storage stationary drawers (ender_drawer disabled). Added Create Stuff & Additions (jetpacks blocked), Create Liquid Fuel, and Clockwork Additions.",
    "biomes": "Regions Unexplored + Biomes O' Plenty + Terralith + Tectonic + Alex's Caves + thematic sub-biomes with vanilla vertical limits.",
    "structures": "YUNG full suite + Towns & Towers + IDAS + Dungeons and Taverns + Hopo + When Dungeons Arise + Structory + Formations + Archeology + Bountiful + Recruits. Added Structurify density control and Easy NPC site dispatchers.",
    "world": "Ambient wildlife, bosses/encounters, weathering, snow physics, and client audiovisual atmosphere.",
    "building": "Architecture, framing, chipped/rechiseled, Macaw suite, Quark, Sully's Mod, Immersive Paintings, and wood/stone/clay variants.",
    "food": "Expanded Farmer's Delight ecosystem, Fruit Trees, Productive Bees, Culinary Construct, Diet, and Aquaculture without temperature locks. Added Create Confectionery.",
    "performance": "Client/server optimization stack with Embeddium/Oculus/Saturn/Noisium/ModernFix/FastWorkbench/RyoamicLights (radium excluded due to Valkyrien Skies POI mixin conflict). Added FastFurnace and Does It Tick for 175k-world TPS stability. Added Smooth Boot Reloaded.",
    "qol": "Compasses, Tetra+Extras, Combat Roll, JEI/EMI integrations, manuals, tooltips, UI polish, and voice chat addons without bulk backpacks or teleportation. Added Corpse, Better Spawner Control, Paxi, EntityJS, Game/Recipe/Item Stages, and FancyMenu/Drippy/ResourcePackOverrides/JustZoom client polish. Added Default Server Properties and Simple Discord RPC (client-only)."
  },
